# Convex bindings are regenerated by `npx convex dev`, and a committed copy of
# that output lives in `scripts/convex-bindings/`. `bun run build` restores the
# copy if this folder is missing, which is what lets hosts without Convex
# credentials (Vercel, CI) typecheck and resolve `@/convex/_generated/api`.
src/convex/_generated
.env.local
node_modules
dist
